5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, young ones. Let us seek truth with calm hearts.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I will observe the flow of the discussion.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,May,,"Hi everyone! Let's make this fun, shall we?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good evening. I prefer to listen before I speak.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi! I'm Sakura! Who wants to play a guessing game?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from patience. Let us not rush to judgment.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. Rushing often leads to mistakes.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,May,,I like the sound of that. Slow and steady.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
