15,0,3,talk,Servas,,Each of us holds a piece of the puzzle.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"We must trust our instincts, but verify them.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
