19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,Facts are boring. I like mysteries!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,Let the night reveal what the day conceals.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I will keep my thoughts to myself for now.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
